          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"episode-level-atlas\">Episode-level atlas</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">One point per demonstration: each episode's 14-D state trajectory is\nresampled to 32 timesteps and flattened into a fixed-length signature,\nso whole behaviors \u2014 not frames \u2014 are compared.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Things to try:</span>\n<ul>\n<li>Color by <code>subtask</code>: same-behavior demos should form tight clusters.\n  Demos far from their cluster are candidates for review (weird\n  teleop, mislabeled task, unusual scene layout).</li>\n<li>Color by <code>duration_s</code> to spot abnormally slow demonstrations.</li>\n<li>The rare <em>remove-from-wrong-tray</em> recovery demos sit in their own\n  corners \u2014 a direct view of dataset imbalance.</li>\n</ul></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
